## Deployment

### Local Development
\\\ash
npm run dev           # Start all services with Docker Compose
npm run down          # Stop services
npm run down-volumes  # Stop and reset database
\\\

### Production (Cloudflare Pages + Workers)

See [DEPLOYMENT.md](./DEPLOYMENT.md) for detailed instructions.

#### Quick Deploy
\\\ash
# Frontend to Cloudflare Pages
npm run deploy:frontend

# Backend to Cloudflare Workers
npm run deploy:backend

# Both
npm run deploy
\\\

#### Automated Deployment
Push to \main\ branch triggers GitHub Actions CI/CD:
- Runs tests and linting
- Builds frontend and backend
- Deploys to Cloudflare Pages (frontend)
- Deploys to Cloudflare Workers (backend)

