## Notes

- **Local**: Uses Docker Compose (PostgreSQL, Redis, Backend, Frontend)
- **Production**: Cloudflare Pages (frontend) + Cloudflare Workers (backend)
- **Database**: Local PostgreSQL for development; managed database for production
- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions auto-deploys on push to \main\
